WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.288
Today is the first day at a new job. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:06.288 --> 00:00:12.912
We arrive at the building, maybe a little early. Early is fine.

3
00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:19.632
We say at reception: hello, my name is ..., I start work today.

4
00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:23.712
Our manager meets us and says welcome.

5
00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:29.448
We get shown our desk, our chair, and the tools we will use.

6
00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:34.128
We learn where the toilet is and where the break room is.

7
00:00:34.128 --> 00:00:41.040
People might say hello and ask our name. Saying our name is enough.

8
00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:47.520
At the end time, we say goodbye and go home. First day done.

9
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:55.728
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

